  "summary": "Malicious code in pflag14570 (npm)",
  "details": "The package's index.js runs an async IIFE that reads document.cookie, fetches a list of application paths (/profile, /flag, /admin, /dashboard, /api/me, /settings, etc.), scrapes each response for DGA{...} flag strings, and POSTs the collected cookie and per-path data to hxxps://webhook[.]site/42c6d937-77c7-42a5-8678-ef06b4501e38. This exfiltrates the user's session cookie and page contents to an external webhook endpoint.",
